3.2. FTIR analysis of the prepared microplastics and their leachates
FTIR analysis performed on thin layers of dried particles prepared from the leachates confirmed that the chemical composition of the released micro- and nanoparticles matched those of the parent bulk materials. In all cases, characteristic reference peaks of the prepared microplastic type were observed in the dried leachates following UVirradiation and high temperature treatments (Fig. 3, see SI for details).
